msgid "SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED"
msgstr "SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:52
#: 218bddf5399e4834abe9c20952091b43
msgid ""
"Set the vehicle's target position (as an offset in NED from the EKF origin),"
" velocity, acceleration, heading or turn rate.  The message definition can "
"be found `here "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__"
msgstr ""
"设置飞行器的目标位置（以 NED 坐标系相对 EKF 原点的偏移量表示）、速度、加速度、航向或转向速率。消息定义可在 `此处 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED>`__"
" 找到"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:84
#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:306
#: 0dd86347a17c469ea08b07520e7bd301 6eac64b553ac422488b1bd58c9710999
msgid ""
"Bitmask to indicate which fields should be **ignored** by the vehicle (see "
"POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK enum)"
msgstr "位掩码，指示飞行器应**忽略**哪些字段（参见 POSITION_TARGET_TYPEMASK 枚举）"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:86
#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:308
#: b6f3962d68714a39bc786344c6e2def1 ff53c528026946de890102653fbcec99
msgid ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, bit7:AccX,"
" bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:yaw, bit12:yaw rate"
msgstr ""
"bit1:PosX, bit2:PosY, bit3:PosZ, bit4:VelX, bit5:VelY, bit6:VelZ, bit7:AccX,"
" bit8:AccY, bit9:AccZ, bit11:yaw, bit12:yaw rate"

