#: 53c7723ddd46421aa5f150a3b6ad8236 c654a21901ea4b7f98849980b3cdcc8b
msgid ""
"When providing Pos, Vel and/or Accel all 3 axis must be provided.  At least "
"one of Pos, Vel and Accel must be provided (e.g. providing Yaw or YawRate "
"alone is not supported)"
