msgstr "将偏航角速率指定为零可防止飞行器偏航变化"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:209
#: 358a7271c5994ed2a28c14b80688ac9f
msgid ""
"In frames, ``_OFFSET_`` means \"relative to vehicle position\" while "
"``_LOCAL_`` is \"relative to home position\" (these have no impact on "
"*velocity* directions). ``_BODY_`` means that velocity components are "
"relative to the heading of the vehicle rather than the NED frame."
msgstr ""
"在坐标系中，``_OFFSET_`` 表示「相对于飞行器位置」，而 ``_LOCAL_`` 表示「相对于 Home "
"位置」（这对*速度*方向没有影响）。``_BODY_`` 表示速度分量相对于飞行器航向而非 NED 坐标系。"

#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:213
#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:374
#: 0c90bb4bf5fa47c4b7bfc9f4948e1e10 ba8423ae44fc4d449c2203bff93b61e4
msgid ""
"If sending velocity or acceleration commands, they should be re-sent every "
"second (the vehicle will stop after 3 seconds if no command is received)"
