#: ../../source/docs/copter-commands-in-guided-mode.rst:257
#: c9e487cf55284c52b613af2a6f35258a
msgid ""
"Set the vehicle's target position (in WGS84 coordinates), velocity, heading "
"or turn rate.  This is similar to the SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED message "
"(see above) except positions are provided as latitude and longitude values "
"and altitudes can be above sea-level, relative to home or relative to "
"terrain."
msgstr ""
"设置飞行器的目标位置（以 WGS84 坐标表示）、速度、航向或转向速率。此消息与 SET_POSITION_TARGET_LOCAL_NED "
"消息类似（见上文），区别在于位置以纬度和经度值提供，高度可以是海平面高度、相对 Home 的高度或相对地形的高度。"

